-- OPSC Scientific Officer Recruitment 2026: 89 posts, applications 6 November to 26 November 2026, exam 17 January 2027
-- VERIFIED 29 October 2026: OdishaTV report (published 29 October 2026) and GovtJobsAlert guide agree on the 89 posts, Advertisement No. 14 of 2026-27, divisions, dates, pay, fee and exam pattern; notification dated 28 October 2026. Live sitemap checked this run, no OPSC Scientific Officer slug present.
